style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">R</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">Q</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">P</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">O</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">N</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">24</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">23</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">22</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">21</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">20</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">19</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">18</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">17</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">16</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">15</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">14</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">13</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">12</td></tr></table><p>So, CYLINDE would be spelt as 1231071223.</p><p>So, option (a) is the correct answer. </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In a certain code language, \"526\" is coded as \"1052\" and \"742\" is coded as \"1484\", then what is the code for \"964\"?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2349;&#2366;&#2359;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, \"526\" &#2325;&#2379; \"1052\" &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; \"742\" &#2325;&#2379; \"1484\" &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; \"964\" &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1824</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1824</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1928</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1928</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1328</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1328</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1524</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1524</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>In this</p><p>526 ----- 526 x 2 = 1052</p><p>742 ----- 742 x 2 = 1484</p><p>Similarly, </p><p>964 ----- 964 x 2 = 1928</p><p>So, option (b) is the correct answer. </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If FUTURE is coded as HWVWTG, then what is the code for PLANET?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; FUTURE &#2325;&#2379; HWVWTG &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; PLANET &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">RNCPGV</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">RNCPGV</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">QMBOFU</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">QMBOFU</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">SNDOHW</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">SNDOHW</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">PMBOFU</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">PMBOFU</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Each letter is shifted two places forward in the alphabet.</p><p>F&rarr;H, U&rarr;W, T&rarr;V, U&rarr;W, R&rarr;T, E&rarr;G</p><p>Therefore, FUTURE&rarr;HWVWTG</p><p>Apply the same to PLANET:</p><p>P&rarr;R, L&rarr;N, A&rarr;C, N&rarr;P, E&rarr;G, T&rarr;V</p><p>PLANET&rarr;RNCPGV</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If SCRIPT is coded as UETKRV, what is the code for EDITOR?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; SCRIPT &#2325;&#2379; UETKRV &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; EDITOR &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">GFKVQT</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">GFKVQT</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">HGLWRU</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">HGLWRU</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">EDIRMT</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">EDIRMT</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">FGKVQT</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">FGKVQT</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>From SCRIPT&rarr;UETKRV,</p><p>rule => add 2 to each letter's alphabetical position</p><p>EDITOR positions = E(5), D(4), I(9), T(20), O(15), R(18)</p><p>Add 2: 5+2=7, 4+2=6, 9+2=11, 20+2=22, 15+2=17, 18+2=20</p><p>Map back: 7&rarr;G, 6&rarr;F, 11&rarr;K, 22&rarr;V, 17&rarr;Q, 20&rarr;T &rarr; <b>GFKVQT</b></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If DANGER is coded as ECQKJX, what is the code for MAGNET?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; DANGER &#2325;&#2379; ECQKJX &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; MAGNET &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">NBHNIY</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">NBHNIY</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">NCJRJZ</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">NCJRJZ</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">NBJRJX</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">NBJRJX</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">MDGSKY</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">MDGSKY</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>From DANGER&rarr;ECQKJX,</p><p>rule = add the letter's position in the word to its alphabetical position</p><p>MAGNET positions = M(13)+1, A(1)+2, G(7)+3, N(14)+4, E(5)+5, T(20)+6 &rarr; 14, 3, 10, 18, 10, 26</p><p>Map: 14&rarr;N, 3&rarr;C, 10&rarr;J, 18&rarr;R, 10&rarr;J, 26&rarr;Z &rarr; <b>NCJRJZ</b></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In a certain code language, <b>\"ARIZON\" </b>is written as <b>\"2615149181\"</b>. How is <b>\"TENSED\" </b>written in that code language?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2349;&#2366;&#2359;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, <b>\"ARIZON\" </b>&#2325;&#2379;<b> \"2615149181\" </b>&#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;| &#2313;&#2360; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2349;&#2366;&#2359;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; <b>\"TENSED\"</b> &#2325;&#2379;<b> </b>&#2325;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">195414520</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">195414520</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">195114520</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">195114520</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">159205419</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">159205419</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">201945120</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">201945120</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Letters of ARIZON are firstly arranged as &#8594; ZONIRA &#8594; then corresponding letter number is written&#8594; 26 for Z, 15 for O, and so on.</p><p>Similar logic is followed for TENSED &#8594;code is 195414520</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In a coded language, <b>PERSEVERATE</b> is coded as <b>EEPRSVAEERT, </b>then what will be the code for <b>POMEGRANATE</b>? </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2349;&#2366;&#2359;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, <b>PERSEVERATE</b> &#2325;&#2379; <b>EEPRSVAEERT</b> &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; <b>POMEGRANATE</b> &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">EGMOPRAENTA</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">EGMOPRAENTA</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">EGPOMRAAENT</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">EGPOMRAAENT</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">EGMOPRAAENT</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">EGMOPRAAENT</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">EGMOARPAENT</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">EGMOARPAENT</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Here, the alphabet in the middle is not changed. The first and last five alphabets are written in alphabetical order. </p><p>Hence, POMEGRANATE -- <b>EGMOPRAAENT</b></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In a certain code language, 'PUMA' is coded as '102' and 'NIKE' is coded as '78'. How will 'FILA' be coded in that language?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2349;&#2366;&#2359;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, 'PUMA' &#2325;&#2379; '102' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; 'NIKE' &#2325;&#2379; '78' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2349;&#2366;&#2359;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 'FILA' &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">92</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">92</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">84</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">84</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">56</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">56</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">70</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">70</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">A (1)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">B (2)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">C (3)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">D (4)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">E (5)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">F (6)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">G (7)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">H (8)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">I (9)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">J (10)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">K (11)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">L (12)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">M (13)</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">Z (26)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">Y (25)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">X (24)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">W (23)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">V (22)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">U (21)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">T (20)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">S (19)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">R (18)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">Q (17)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">P (16)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">O (15)</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">N (14)</td></tr></table><p>P (16), U (21), M (13), A (1)</p><p>16 + 21 + 13 + 1 = 51  X  2 = 102</p><p>N (14), I (9), K (11), E (5)</p><p>14 + 9 + 11 + 5 = 39  X  2 = 78</p><p>Similarly,</p><p>F (6), I (9), L (12), A (1)</p><p>6 + 9 + 12 + 1 = 28  X  2 = <b>56</b></p><p>Thus, the answer is option (c).</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If CARPET is coded as TCEAPR, then the code for NATIONAL would be</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; CARPET &#2325;&#2379; TCEAPR &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; NATIONAL &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">NLATNOIA</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">NLATNOIA</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">LANOITAN</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">LANOITAN</span